msgstr ""

msgctxt "/3703B8D149E864D3F171FEBD17CB0967"
msgid ""
"- Team has identified key substrate used in Mr. Ludwig’s process.\n"
"- “Restorative Gel Mixture”\n"
"- Encourages cellular regeneration and tissue growth.\n"
"- Integral to Experiment successful outcomes.\n"
"- Spreads indefinitely when untreated and exposed to biomass.\n"
"\n"
"Chemical analysis indicates some similarities to DMEM. Comparable levels of "
"salt, amino acids, and B vitamins. However, Ludwig’s mixture outperforms all "
"other commercially available culture mediums."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "/1AE692E843CA34C9CCAA1AA8081AFB9B"
msgid ""
"- Team has successfully recreated this medium in a lab environment.\n"
"- Now able to create, modify, and neutralize the medium as well (see "
"“Negation Compound”).\n"
"- Negation Compound renders the medium inert. Required for preventing "
"“runaway overgrowth” caused by self-replication."
msgstr ""

