msgctxt "/42ADB7E04FDD7AB29B3C9585517219FC"
msgid ""
"Boggy stole my things again. Pretty things in his ugly paws. Sitting in his "
"rotting little rat hole. MY pretty things.\n"
"\n"
"HAVE TO KILL HIM. STICK SOMETHING SHARP BETWEEN HIS RIBS. BURN OUT HIS EYES. "
"TAKE HIS THINGS.\n"
"\n"
"KILL OR DIE. KILL OR DIE. KILL OR DIE.\n"
"\n"
"I ate GOOD today. Gave some to my friends, too. Poor, stupid Boggy. At least "
"he had nice taste.\n"
"\n"
"Gnawing on the bones now, thinking about how it’s all mine if I want it to "
"be. Everything. Boggy’s things. Gnat’s things. Roach and Yiggy’s, too. But "
"the more things, the more eyes you draw. The more eyes, the more they skitter "
"for your stuff. Friends one second, enemies the next.\n"
"\n"
"I’m not scared. I’m NEVER scared. Not of THEM. Let them watch. Let them take. "
"Let them talk and laugh and joke. No matter how wrong they are beneath their "
"rotting skin, their wasted muscles and jagged teeth–the marrow all tastes the "
"same."
msgstr ""

