msgctxt "/66FF3B8D4D15295C7B63A5AF090ADC45"
msgid ""
"Engineering Team,\n"
"\n"
"Team, I just wanted to say, for a bunch of socially maldeveloped super "
"geniuses who can miraculously pull together miracles JUST ahead of "
"deadline…\n"
"\n"
"You are all absolute morons.\n"
"\n"
"Let me break down the “concepts” (I say derogatorily)  you’ve sent "
"me:\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"“Gravity” Hand – Really? THIS is the fantasy the company’s Innovation dime is "
"going toward?\n"
"Gun Hand “Gunny Wunny” – First, a pox on whoever came up with this travesty "
"of a name. Second, are you seriously about to give a bunch of overworked and "
"severely underpaid 9-to-9ers a GUN HAND? Let’s think about this…\n"
"“Big Freaking Fist” – What employee under Playtime’s payroll needs a fist? "
"Please, enlighten me. I would love to hear your reasoning, and then promptly "
"hand you a straitjacket.\n"
"\n"
"Please, the LAST thing I need in lead reviews is to show THESE travesties off "
"like they’re serious projects. Promptly toss these down into Recycling & "
"Reclamation, and let’s forget ALL about them. I know I intend to.\n"
"\n"
"Adam Worthy\n"
"Head of Engineering"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "/6785EEDF4E7075053622CA828D847551"
msgid ""
"Entry 1:\n"
"Subject placed in constructed “home” environment.\n"
"Displays signs of environmental displacement: persistent pacing, heavy "
"respiration, aversion to enclosed corners.\n"
"Attempts to locate exits suggest the subject does not yet recognize the "
"habitat as its own.\n"
"The subject does not acknowledge researchers when we remain inside the "
"enclosure, provided disguises are maintained. Observation Rooms remain "
"undetected.\n"
"Continue monitoring acclimation behavior. Red Smoke sedation is "
"advised.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Jessica Newman\n"
"\n"
"Entry 2:\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Two months have passed. Movements are less frantic–more purposeful.\n"
"The experiment now navigates the space with confidence, finding comfort in "
"what it believes to be its home–where it belongs.\n"
"Disguised staff experience minimal aggression in interaction.\n"
"It believes the “friends” around it are genuine members of its social "
"group.\n"
"Similar to the children in Playcare, the experiment appears to welcome Red "
"Smoke sedation.\n"
"\n"
"Still, I worry. Its stability relies entirely on the illusion; a single "
"breach collapses the trust we’ve engineered. If more lives become the cost of "
"operating this “Sweet Street,” can we say it was truly worth pursuing?\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Jessica Newman\n"
msgstr ""

