msgctxt "/909D840747833B4986699F86FE0FF0E3"
msgid ""
"Experiment 4\n"
"Pus on the plush skin. Bubbling. Throat gurgled as he drew his first breath. "
"Stitching unraveled. Eyes wild. Bone, meat, and blood oozed onto the table as "
"he drew a second breath. A third. A fourth. A fifth. There was no "
"sixth.\n"
"\n"
"Growth Medium resists imposed limits.\n"
"\n"
"How was this controlled?\n"
"\n"
"Watch again.\n"
"\n"
"Experiment 8\n"
"Submerging in tanks. Attempting concentration changes by keeping subjects "
"submerged. Biology becomes more… pliable. \n"
"\n"
"Noting progress. \n"
"\n"
"Experiment 15\n"
"Doctor Sawyer’s cooperation is proving useful, if inconsequential. \n"
"\n"
"Eyes wide. Stitching holds. Limbs flail.\n"
"\n"
"“It burns,” he shouts. I watch. Learn.\n"
"\n"
"Blood spills from his mouth. Eyes turn to glass. I split him open from the "
"back, and find it all gone– muscle, bone, and the Growth Medium.\n"
"\n"
"The Negation Formula proves equally as difficult to control. It consumes. The "
"Growth Medium desires to grow, and the Negation Formula desires to "
"destroy.\n"
"\n"
"Experiment 28\n"
"Medium bonding. Negation Formula controlling the growth.\n"
"\n"
"Her stitching holds. Eyes flicker with life. Fingers sliding on the "
"table–feeling the cold metal.\n"
"\n"
"Who am I? she asks. Who are you?\n"
"\n"
"A giver. I tell her. A friend.\n"
"\n"
"And you are Gabi.\n"
"\n"
"She repeats the name and closes her eyes.\n"
"\n"
"Experiment 34\n"
"\n"
"They live. They breathe. They walk and talk.\n"
"\n"
"But I’m still no nearer to infinity. \n"
"\n"
"I won’t be alone.\n"
"\n"
"It is a necessity that I keep going.\n"
msgstr ""

