msgctxt "/FD5B18E449AA99EC2E666DB8DC6272CB"
msgid ""
"Julie,\n"
"\n"
"I hope the harvest this year has been good to you and your father, and I’m "
"sorry I missed your 9th at the start of the year. I’ve found myself missing "
"home (like, a LOT). \n"
"\n"
"Life here is so contained, so focused on the work and the end goals, that I "
"have no time at all for a personal life. The goals of this project are grand. "
"Beautiful, even. Everyone here talks about it with such passion, such zeal, "
"that like me, EVERYONE signed up for it without much question. The work "
"itself, however, is nothing I can talk about openly. The processes themselves "
"are difficult. I question it deeply, and I know I’m not the only one who "
"does. Comforts are few in the Lab, and I think this has changed a lot of us. "
"I know enough about what happens to a brain in isolation to know that’s "
"exactly what’s happening here.\n"
"\n"
"I’ve been thinking a LOT about home recently. When I close my eyes, I can "
"almost feel it. Hayseed in my shoes. The taste of fresh lemonade in summer. "
"Your father’s ugly leather boots that tracked dirt all the way up to the "
"second-floor bedroom. Ranger barking out the back door at foxes. \n"
"\n"
"Most of all, I think back to a few of the lessons I taught you. I think about "
"all those nights spent nestled on the porch with you, the two of us wrapped "
"so tight as the corn waves in the field. I want to give you a better world "
"than the one I’d inherited. To give you something worth fighting for, just "
"like my parents gave me. Something my dad always said stuck with me, and I "
"know you’ve heard me say it. It’s my hope that you believe it like I "
"do:\n"
"\n"
"“Start by doing good at a smaller scale. The smallest. Make that your world. "
"Do everything possible to keep it safe and grow it responsibly.”  \n"
"\n"
"Love you, my little tulip. I miss your beautiful face, and I miss our porch "
"time. I’ll try to come home soon.\n"
"\n"
"Yours,\n"
"Dr. Chloe Arkins\n"
msgstr ""

