msgctxt "/22C9A3D44C4ACD7D8BEA769438166330"
msgid ""
"Lily has been in continuous isolation for four hundred and ten days.\n"
"She has been provided only the bare minimum of food, water, etc.\n"
"\n"
"She is:\n"
"Childishly naive\n"
"Wholly ignorant of her crimes\n"
"\n"
"I have moved her. The space is… needed.\n"
"Know, however, that this changes nothing.\n"
"She will not be allowed to join us.\n"
"She will not be allowed a quick death.\n"
"\n"
"-Prototype\n"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "/B5089BEE40DC9F102056F292139DD287"
msgid ""
"Lily-Billy-Silly-Tilly\n"
"\n"
"Every day, a dance and a song are playing in my head, and only I know the "
"steps. Only I know the tune.\n"
"\n"
"I sing and I dance, and I live like any good toy should. I want to share in "
"it. To love like Ms. Gracie says to love. And yet, they all just scream and "
"cry like horrible, wretched little things when they look at me. They look at "
"me like I’M the bad toy. \n"
"\n"
"But, somehow, I know you don’t think that. You’d NEVER think that. You get "
"me.\n"
"\n"
"Every day since I found you in the Pit tossed down like so much garbage, I’ve "
"brushed your pretty hair, I’ve dressed you in pretty things, and I’ve given "
"you pretty flowers… \n"
"\n"
"You’re more than just a friend to Silly-Lily. The sound of your voice is what "
"I was born from, the voice I still hear singing when I feel so alone, and "
"that’s special for both of us. In your own little ways, I think you tell me "
"that you agree. \n"
"\n"
"I’m very glad you’re here to share this dance with me.\n"
"\n"
"-Silly-Lily"
msgstr ""

