msgctxt "/5BAB23B54355A4DA6CF4BCB5D3CBC9AB"
msgid ""
"Patient Information\n"
"\n"
"Name: Eddie M.N. Ritterman\n"
"DOB: 03/06/1946\n"
"MRN: 9852761\n"
"Sex: Male\n"
"Dx Date: 1968\n"
"Attending Physician: Dr. Michaels\n"
"Date of Visit: 11/15/1994\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"SUBJECTIVE:\n"
"Patient reports increasing difficulty with ambulation. States a growing "
"weakness in the quadriceps and grip strength. Denies any notable falls, but "
"details “near falls” as a daily occurrence. Patient believes he is "
"experiencing a more rapid physical deterioration. Mild dysarthria noted. "
"Tongue fasciculations observed.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"OBJECTIVE:\n"
"- Vitals WNL\n"
"\n"
"- Notable atrophy of the bilateral quadriceps\n"
"\n"
"- Hand grip strength: decreased vs. prior visit\n"
"\n"
"- Gait: slow, unsteady, requires an assistive device\n"
"\n"
"- No signs of acute distress otherwise\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"ASSESSMENT:\n"
"Dx: Spinal and bulbar muscular atrophy (Kennedy’s Disease)--progressive, "
"degenerative myopathy. Disease progression consistent with expectations. "
"Increased weakness likely due to natural progression.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"PLAN:\n"
"- Continue supportive care: PT, OT as tolerated\n"
"\n"
"- Reinforce fall precautions\n"
"\n"
"- Refill prescriptions for pain medication.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"NOTES:\n"
"Remember to maintain positivity!\n"
msgstr ""

