msgctxt "/00AEC0AA44149F06811EE3AFDE8CF31B"
msgid ""
"THE BETTER PRESS                                           Issue #14, Oct "
"2003\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"BURNT ENDS\n"
"Missing Toy Mystery solved!\n"
"\n"
"For years, we toys speculated about what happened to Gentle John - some "
"daring to spread the lie that he and his Joyless fled our factory during the "
"Hour of Joy. These rumors were put to rest, Tuesday, when the burnt up bodies "
"of twenty three toys were found in the innovation wing and confirmed to be "
"the presumed defector. \n"
"\n"
"“John refused to fight for us during the Hour of Joy. Spare no tears for him "
"and the Joyless. There is no hope for us above,” said our liberator, the "
"Prototype. \n"
"\n"
"A vigil will be held in town square this upcoming Joy Day. All are ENCOURAGED "
"to attend. The first 10 attendees will be given special mourning stickers. "
"Continued on Page 2…\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"UNSAFE HAVEN\n"
"\n"
"As food supplies run low, rebel toys in Safe Haven have been reportedly "
"eating each other! \n"
"\n"
"“It’s way beyond salvaging from the charnel pit,” said a former rebel who "
"didn’t want to be named. \n"
"\n"
"“The place stinks so bad of soggy plush and blood. It’s super bad. "
"”\n"
"\n"
"Though others deny the claims, it’s widely known that rebel toy, Doey the "
"Doughman has a big appetite and previously ate  at least one of his parents. "
"Continued on page 4.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"DON’T GET ON THE WRONG SIDE OF THESE SAVINGS:\n"
"2 FOR 1 POPSICLES AT THE JIMMIE’S FOOD BARN"
msgstr ""

