msgctxt "/11EF721948CAF182D27C13BADA7E30B2"
msgid ""
"To Whomever Finds This,\n"
"\n"
"My name is Doctor Preston Willard. I’m a Biologist, and I’ve committed "
"atrocities in the pursuit of unattainable science.  \n"
"\n"
"One hundred and fifty people—whose names I’ve listed at the bottom of this "
"document—each played a part in this, one of humanity’s gravest crimes. "
"Whatever their motives, they are all complicit.\n"
"\n"
"I tried changing it all from the inside. Tried reasoning. Tried everything. I "
"was desperate and scared, and I made a deal with the devil just to make it "
"all stop. I leaked dates and details. I suggested that certain people meet "
"and talk. I created the upheaval that allowed this to happen, that left "
"everyone looking away from what they should’ve. All for him.\n"
"\n"
"I believed the Prototype was a victim. A child forced to become something "
"else. Something more. I believed the deal I’d struck would let them go free. "
"That it would end the work. I’d read his history, who he USED to be. I let my "
"assumptions about his actions guide me. The reality is, the Prototype is a "
"monster. A copycat who's seen the worst in us and wants nothing more than to "
"give it all back.\n"
"\n"
"I pushed the button. I let him out. Thousands are dead. I thought I was doing "
"a good thing, but NOBODY can do good things. Not in a place like "
"this.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe something good can come from all of this if you tell the world. Tell "
"them about me. Tell them about this place. Tell them that history should not "
"remember us for what we TRIED to do, but for what we did. \n"
"\n"
"Jessica. Marcas. I’m sorry. \n"
"\n"
"-Dr. Preston Willard\n"
"\n"
"The Guilty\n"
"- Dr. Preston Willard\n"
"- Leith Pierre\n"
"- Edward M.N. Ritterman\n"
"- Dr. Harley Sawyer\n"
"- Dr. Bruno White"
msgstr ""

