msgctxt "/0B1D735D4125537EDE928184D6F55D64"
msgid ""
"Unknown Sender #1: They all go on (at great length) about this imagined "
"future of theirs. It’s exhausting. Their eyes are so set on a new chapter of "
"history that they ignore the current one.\n"
"\n"
"Unknown Sender #2: Remember, we used to believe in that future too (Hard to "
"turn down the prospect of a world where humanity lives without strife until "
"the stars wink out).\n"
"\n"
"Unknown Sender #1: I never stopped believing, I just stopped ignoring the "
"cost.\n"
"\n"
"Unknown Sender #2: One of the mind’s many strengths, I suppose; its ability "
"to ignore its own capacity for cruelty. Just have patience. Our deal with "
"1006 still holds, and I doubt he’d back out of it now.\n"
"\n"
"Unknown Sender #1: Good. Making preparations as we speak."
msgstr ""

